# Kanon local state: the fjall on-disk KV substrate written by `kanon gate`,
# `kanon lint`, and the kanon MCP server. Per-machine, never source. The
# trailing slash matters — it scopes this to the directory and leaves the
# tracked `.kanon-ci.toml`, `.kanon-lint-baseline.toml`, and
# `.kanon-lint-ignore` config files alone.
.kanon/

